<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Saved to the uttermost; Jesus is near;</l><l>Keeping me safely, He casteth out fear;</l><l>Trusting His promises, how I am blest;</l><l>Leaning upon Him, how sweet is my rest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Saved to the uttermost: this I can say,</l><l>“Once all was darkness, but now it is day.”</l><l>Beautiful visions of glory I see;</l><l>Jesus in brightness revealed unto me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Saved to the uttermost: cheerfully sing</l><l>Loud hallelujahs to Jesus my King!</l><l>Ransomed and pardoned, redeemed by His blood,</l><l>Cleansed from unrighteousness, glory to God!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
